course: dictionary
lesson: 8135
title: Reply: answering in words, writing or action
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: To reply is to answer. You can reply by speaking, by writing or by doing something. A reply is the answer itself, to a question, a letter or a message. «No, not one little song,» replied the Rat firmly. The Rat answered out loud, and his answer was firm.
explain: Look at the words around reply to find its meaning. In «When invited to a party, reply by the date asked», the clue is invited: an invitation needs an answer. Try your meaning in the sentence: "answer by the date asked" still makes sense, so reply means answer.
explain: Reply can be a verb (I reply, she replied, we are replying) or a noun (a reply, replies). Phrases like «reply to», «in reply to» and «no reply» help you use it. «Many job applications get no reply at all» means nobody answered.
fact: Reply means to answer, in words, writing or action.
fact: A reply is an answer to a question, letter or message.
fact: «Reply to all» sends your answer to everyone on a message.
fact: Do not reply to mean messages; save them, block the sender and tell an adult.
fact: When you reply to an invitation by the date asked, the host knows how many children are coming.
exercise: «When invited to a party, reply by the date asked.» What does reply mean here? | Dance at the party | Throw it away | Hide the invitation | *Answer the invitation
exercise: «No, not one little song,» replied the Rat firmly. Which word means the Rat answered? | *replied | firmly | little | song
exercise: A stranger sends Mia a mean message. What should she do? | Send it to all her friends | Reply to all | *Save it, block the sender and tell an adult | Reply with something meaner
test: «Many job applications get no reply at all.» What does no reply mean? | The job was given to them | They got a reply the next day | Someone answered very quickly | *Nobody answered them at all
test: What does «reply to all» do on a message? | *Sends your answer to everyone on the message | Sends your answer only to the sender | Stops other people seeing it | Deletes the message
exam: Which word is a noun in «Her reply came quickly»? | quickly | *reply | her | came
